      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOODTIME MIKI (2) is hard to knock having come from wider barriers and dug deep to get home in his last two outings at this circuit and distance. Rises a little in grade but the good draw gives him the chance to land the hat trick. FOUR FEATHERS (9) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when he came from this row and finished 4 metres from the winner when third in a higher-graded race at this venue. Drawn to enjoy a nice run and if he gets the gaps could threaten. IRE OF THE DRAGON (5) could be close to a win after placing in his last two outings here, the latest from this barrier when he raced parked but stuck on for third. ROCKNROLL CLARRY (7) showed improvement to finish runner-up from the back row when second-up here last week and while drawn wider he could progress further third up.",
